@host = http://localhost:5255
@token = PASTE_A_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN

### Health check
GET {{host}}/

### One day's tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?date=2026-11-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Last 14 days
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/history?days=14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Matrix
GET {{host}}/api/matrix
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
